stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Admitted: definitions and group admitted
  Admitted --> LeadingConditions
  LeadingConditions --> NotApplicable: a condition did not pass
  LeadingConditions --> ApplicabilityFailed: a condition unresolved
  LeadingConditions --> Planned: all passed
  Planned --> Waiting: staged prerequisite open
  Planned --> InFlight: ready, or speculative
  Waiting --> InFlight: every earlier entry settled and passed
  Waiting --> NotSent: an earlier entry did not pass, failed or was cancelled
  InFlight --> Settled: run outcome admitted
  Settled --> Reduced
  NotSent --> Reduced
  Reduced --> Judged: gates pass, run completed
  Reduced --> NotApplicable: a gate or condition did not pass
  Reduced --> ApplicabilityFailed: gate call failed or condition unresolved
  Reduced --> EvaluationFailed: gates pass, rules request failed or refused
  Reduced --> Cancelled
  Judged --> [*]
  NotApplicable --> [*]
  ApplicabilityFailed --> [*]
  EvaluationFailed --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
